sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant W as Web/SDK
    participant A as API Gateway
    participant S as Safety
    participant R as Retrieval
    participant G as GPU Router
    participant M as Model Backend
    participant E as Evaluator
    participant O as Observability
    U->>W: Submit alignment prompt
    W->>A: POST /v1/evaluate
    A->>S: Scan prompt and redact PII
    S->>R: Query safe prompt
    R-->>S: Context + citations
    S->>G: Build request profile
    G-->>S: Backend + fallback chain
    S->>M: Execute inference if allowed
    M-->>E: Candidate answer
    E->>E: Reward, safety, benchmark metrics
    E->>O: Trace events + metrics
    E-->>W: Response + report-ready payload
